   $q$Which phrase best fills the blank at the start of sentence 7?$q$, $q$[{"text":"For this reason","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"confuses-cause-effect"},{"text":"Despite these results","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"false-contrast"},{"text":"In conclusion","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"premature-conclusion"},{"text":"Just as important","is_correct":true}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Just as important$q$, $q$Sentences 7 through 9 add a second advantage of the reefs that agrees with the erosion results, so "Just as important" signals added support. "Despite these results" wrongly suggests the new evidence works against the first paragraph.$q$, 'draft', 'aa188600-a618-5070-b6ce-b986ea6b4591')
